// Native B: barter with the supported traveling-supplies catalog.
{1}{Marek. I buy salvage and sell supplies. Have a look; you might find something useful.}{Marek. I buy salvage and sell supplies. Have a look; you might find something useful.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{B:Let me see your wares.}{}{5}{}{1}{}
