{10}{Anything I can find a buyer for. Put it on the counter and I'll give you a price. Don't expect me to buy out an entire warehouse in one visit; I only carry so much coin.}{Anything I can find a buyer for. Put it on the counter and I'll give you a price. Don't expect me to buy out an entire warehouse in one visit; I only carry so much coin.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{B:Let's trade.}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{12}{Something else.}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{13}{I'll come back later.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{20}{Better when people come here to spend money. Too many arrive with a sword in their hand and leave feet first. Be civil and you'll have no trouble from us.}{Better when people come here to spend money. Too many arrive with a sword in their hand and leave feet first. Be civil and you'll have no trouble from us.}{}{}{}{}
